# Not vendored — the PDF is not this repository's to redistribute, and lives
# outside it under LAB_DIR/spec/. What is pinned is the digest of the exact
# file that was read, so a claim attributed to a specification names a
# specific document rather than a title.
#
# verify_repo.sh requires every file listed in quoted-in= to contain the
# sha256= above. That is the check CLAUDE.md asks a person to do by hand after
# moving any pin ("grep for the old version number"), made into something that
# does not depend on remembering.
